---------
Hi3D v1.0 includes the SPARC3D inference implementation. Original copyright,
attribution, license texts, and per-file modification notices are retained.
The Python package and API names are sparc3d / Sparc3DPipeline.

Hunyuan3D is referenced only by an optional coarse-mesh example adapter. Tencent's
Hunyuan3D implementation and weights are not bundled with or relicensed by this
distribution. External image encoders and any separately obtained model weights
